@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description

[*] --> Submitted : submitted on time
[*] --> Late : submitted after the\nstudent's deadline
Submitted --> Submitted : resubmit before the deadline\n(new file version)
Submitted --> Marked : lecturer marks
Late --> Marked : lecturer marks
Marked --> Marked : lecturer re-marks (reason)\nor HoD changes the mark (reason)
Marked --> Moderated : HoD approves
Moderated --> Released : HoD releases
Released --> [*]
note right of Marked : The lecturer sees the mark.\nThe student does not.
note right of Released : Only now the student sees\nthe mark and the feedback.\nA released mark is final.
@enduml
